---
description: Backscatter NASA Space Apps project rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Read AGENTS.md and CONTEXT.md first.

Backscatter uses NASA–ISRO NISAR SAR data to detect and communicate surface change.

Keep NISAR scientifically central.
Do not call any radar change a flood without classification evidence.
Do not fabricate metrics or citations.
Prefer GCOV-based inundation MVP before advanced InSAR deformation.
Build for a reliable hackathon demo, not maximum architecture complexity.
